# whatever you'd like in evidence's context (right-click) menu;
# "the text that will be show"     mime-type/its-for        open_it_with
#
# open_it_with may denote an application in $PATH, an evidence shared object
# (e.g. /usr/local/lib/evidence/action/info_dial.so), or a command-line
# enclosed in quotation marks ("xmms -e %s"), with (or %u) to pass the
# data-file's complete URL to the applications, or %f if the application
# understands only file-names.  In this case, evidence will try to download
# the file if it is a remote one, and pass the name of the temporary local
# copy to the application.  For this to work, the backend used must support
# downloading (copying using URLs).  If the file is local anyway, everything
# will work as expected in either case.



# menu you get when right-clicking on a file

